{'symbol': 'UNM', 'date': '2021-04-08 11:45:00', 'title': "UNUM, MCLEAN HOSPITAL AND MERU HEALTH PARTNER TO HELP EMPLOYERS SUPPORT THEIR WORKERS' BEHAVIORAL HEALTH", 'text': 'CHATTANOOGA, TENN., APRIL 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- UNUM (NYSE: UNM), A LEADING PROVIDER OF FINANCIAL PROTECTION BENEFITS IN THE U.S. AND U.K., IS COLLABORATING WITH MCLEAN HOSPITAL AND MERU HEALTH TO DEVELOP A HOLISTIC BENEFITS SOLUTION FOCUSED ON PREVENTION TO HELP EMPLOYERS SUPPORT THE BEHAVIORAL HEALTH OF EMPLOYEES.'}